<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="legal-content">
  <p class="last-updated">Last updated: 8 September 2026</p>

  <p>This policy describes how Contacts (<%= Railsdav.site_url %>) collects, uses, and protects your information.</p>

  <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only what is necessary to provide the service:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information:</strong> username, email address (optional), and a securely hashed password.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> vCard records you create, import, or sync to the service.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> IP address, request timestamps, and user agent strings. Logs are retained for a limited period for security and debugging purposes.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Data We Do NOT Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No analytics or tracking scripts.</li>
    <li>No device fingerprinting.</li>
    <li>No advertising identifiers.</li>
    <li>No third-party cookies or tracking pixels.</li>
    <li>No usage telemetry.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To authenticate you and provide CardDAV sync.</li>
    <li>To send essential service communications (if email is provided).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will never sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

  <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>This is a self-hosted application. There is no payment processor.</p>

  <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use a single session cookie to keep you logged in. No tracking or analytics cookies are used. See our <%= link_to "Cookie Policy", cookies_path %> for details.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Passwords are hashed with bcrypt (never stored in plain text).</li>
    <li>All connections are encrypted via HTTPS/TLS.</li>
    <li>CardDAV authentication uses HTTP Basic Auth over TLS.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your data is retained as long as your account is active.</li>
    <li>You can delete individual contacts, entire addressbooks, or export all your data at any time.</li>
    <li>If you wish to have your account and all associated data deleted, contact us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Access</strong> your data &mdash; all contacts are visible in the web UI and via CardDAV sync.</li>
    <li><strong>Export</strong> your data &mdash; in vCard (.vcf), CSV, or JSON format.</li>
    <li><strong>Delete</strong> your data &mdash; remove contacts and addressbooks through the web UI.</li>
    <li><strong>Rectify</strong> your data &mdash; edit any contact directly.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at <strong><%= Railsdav.mailer_from %></strong>.</p>
</div>
